.IX Title "SLMINFO 1"
.TH SLMINFO 1 2024-07-13 "perl v5.38.2" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
slminfo \- get information of a back\-off language model
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBslminfo\fR [\fIoption\fR]... \fIslm_file\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBslminfo\fR tells information of back-off language model '\fIslm_file\fR'. It can 
also print the model to ARPA format.
When no option is given, slminfo will only print number of items in each level 
of the language model.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \fB\-v\fR,\fB\-\-verbose\fR 4
.IX Item "-v,--verbose"
Turn on verbose mode, printing arpa format.
.IP \fB\-p\fR,\fB\-\-pr\fR 4
.IX Item "-p,--pr"
Prefer normal probability than \-log(Pr) which is default. Valid under \fB\-v\fR option.
.IP "\fB\-l\fR,\fB\-\-lexicon\fR \fIdict_file\fR" 4
.IX Item "-l,--lexicon dict_file"
Specify the lexicon. Valid under \fB\-v\fR option. Substitute the word-id with word-text in the output.
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.IX Header "AUTHOR"
Originally written by Phill.Zhang <phill.zhang@sun.com>.
Currently maintained by Kov.Chai <tchaikov@gmail.com>.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBslmprune\fR(1).
